+        "Memory: unbounded. There is no address-space limit (RLIMIT_AS) and neither \
+         --pulse-max-heap nor --summary-cache-max-heap-GB is set, so a single procedure that needs \
+         more memory than the machine has will abort the whole analysis with 'Fatal error: out of \
+         memory'. Run under 'ulimit -v' to get a recorded per-procedure omission instead.@."
+
